text = "Step on up to The Choicer Voicer game show studio!
Each round, a voice clip will play for you and your friends. Impersonate the audio as well as you can. The better your performances, the more points you will receive from a panel of judges.

Whoever has the highest average score at the end wins!"
autowrap_mode = 2

